  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the shadow of Smashy's Shop, Wrench spent his early days scavenging for spare parts. The freeze-dried winds of Cryo-Valley toughened him up, and the parasite gnawing at his optic nerve gave him a… unique perspective on Subchain City. Now, he roams as a self-proclaimed 'Gearhead Prophet,' spreading his gospel of salvaged tech and DDC-infused wisdom.",
    "class": "Tinkerer Techpriest",
    "name": "Wrench",
    "personality": "Eccentric and resourceful, Wrench is a walking junkyard of useless information and surprisingly effective gadgets. He's got the loose grip on sanity one might expect from a parasite-infested duck who grew up on bone-dry winds and coffee. Beneath his rambling exterior lies a strategic mind obsessed with optimizing any raid for DRIP.",
